.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_MD-NULL 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_MD-NULL
.Nd The NULL EVP_MD implementation
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for a NULL digest through the
.Sy EVP_MD
API. This algorithm does nothing and returns 1 for its init, update and
final methods.
.Ss Algorithm Name
The following algorithm is available in the default provider:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqNULL"
.El
.Ss Gettable Parameters
This implementation supports the common gettable parameters described in
.Xr EVP_MD-common 7 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr EVP_MD_CTX_set_params 3 ,
.Xr provider-digest 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7
